      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ну что, до завтра.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "And that's it for this scene. When you watch the episode, listen out for the exchange around an accidental call, and for the words meaning 'fire extinguisher' and 'to hang'. You'll catch them now. See you next time.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ну что, до завтра.",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
